{"id":"16.07.Untouchable","contentHtml":"<p>This project is a special chapter in my history, born despite circumstances. While I was studying at college for a <strong>major far removed from IT</strong>, I realized that my true calling was creating games.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not waiting for the right moment, I started my path myself. I studied C# on my phone during boring lectures, designed levels by hand in a notebook, and in the evenings turned these sketches into a full-fledged 3D world.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key challenge was to <strong>prove to myself that <mark>passion and self-discipline can replace formal IT education</mark></strong>, by creating a full-fledged and deep 3D game from scratch.</p>\n<h2>Engineering and Design Solution</h2>\n<p>The result of this work was not just a demo, but a deep and well-developed game.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Reimagining in 3D:</strong> The mechanics of my very first game (\"don't touch the walls\") were transferred to 3D and turned into a hardcore arcade with exaggerated drift.</li>\n<li><strong>Deep Level Design:</strong> <strong>18 unique levels drawn in a notebook</strong> were created with diverse mechanics: from hidden rooms and traps to an Easter egg with a UFO.</li>\n<li><strong>Full-fledged PC Product:</strong> Implemented a full menu with detailed graphics settings, sound, and <strong>localization into 4 languages</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Full Product Created:</strong> Created a deep game from scratch with 18 levels and all the attributes of a finished PC product.</li>\n<li><strong>Triumph of Self-Learning:</strong> This project is my personal proof that <mark>the path of self-learning, based on passion and persistence, is a real alternative</mark> to formal IT education.</li>\n<li><strong>Career Foundation:</strong> This experience didn't just teach me code and 3D. It <strong>laid my work ethic</strong> and proved that <mark>I can achieve any goal</mark>.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Untouchable","date":"2016-07","type":"project","tagsArray":["PC","Hardcore","Unity","C#","Blender","Photoshop"],"heroVideo":["QVwX9jvGLno"],"shortDescription":"<p>My <strong>manifesto of perseverance</strong>: a hardcore 3D arcade game designed in a notebook while studying a non-IT major at college.</p>\n","role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/card.mp4?v=1765047041819","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/screenshots/1.webp","width":1258,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/screenshots/2.webp","width":1258,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/screenshots/3.webp","width":1258,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/screenshots/4.webp","width":1258,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/screenshots/5.webp","width":1054,"height":930},{"src":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/screenshots/6.webp","width":1054,"height":930},{"src":"/images/projects/16.07.Untouchable/screenshots/7.webp","width":1054,"height":930}]}